  "content": "<h2>Contents</h2><ol><li><p>Welcome to Myoffice Word</p></li><li><p>Everything starts with a first draft</p></li></ol><table style=\"min-width: 75px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p>This is really</p></th><th><p></p></th><th><p></p></th></tr><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Welcome to Myoffice Word</h1><p>A quiet place for your best ideas.</p><p>Start writing here. Use the toolbar to shape your document, add a table or image, and save your work as you go.</p><h2>Everything starts with a first draft</h2><p>Whether you’re preparing a report, sharing a story, or planning your next project, Myoffice gives your words room to grow.</p><blockquote><p>Great work begins with a single sentence.</p></blockquote><p>Try selecting text to make it <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, or <u>underlined</u>.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
